WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:11.091
HEDGE™.
A course for parents, in a confused age.

2
00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.669
I thought I'd know.
I thought I'd see it coming.

3
00:00:16.319 --> 00:00:20.368
Your child is not confused.
Your child is being confused.

4
00:00:21.618 --> 00:00:22.952
We saw it coming.

5
00:00:22.952 --> 00:00:26.130
For almost forty years, we have watched it
grow.

6
00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:30.101
Lesson one.
1988.

7
00:00:30.101 --> 00:00:31.298
The Old Wound.

8
00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:34.793
We were answering these calls in 1988.

9
00:00:35.243 --> 00:00:39.298
We called it a false identity.
Find the hurt, and you find the root.

10
00:00:39.848 --> 00:00:42.374
And we still call it a false identity.

11
00:00:42.824 --> 00:00:45.126
Usually, the hurt was in the family.

12
00:00:45.226 --> 00:00:46.271
Was it us?

13
00:00:46.871 --> 00:00:50.417
The same roots as homosexuality.
Only deeper.

14
00:00:52.967 --> 00:00:54.948
Your homework: find the root.

15
00:00:57.698 --> 00:01:01.275
Someone has a plan for your child.
Have yours.

16
00:01:01.275 --> 00:01:02.232
Free.
Live.

17
00:01:02.232 --> 00:01:02.867
Tonight.

18
00:01:09.548 --> 00:01:13.492
Module one, complete.
Module two unlocks when you're ready.

19
00:01:18.992 --> 00:01:21.691
Lesson two.
2003.

20
00:01:21.691 --> 00:01:22.843
Catch It Early.

21
00:01:23.093 --> 00:01:27.032
Are you afraid your child may be
struggling with gender identity?

22
00:01:27.482 --> 00:01:31.751
We told the churches: a young girl in
Sunday school that might have some gender

23
00:01:31.751 --> 00:01:33.717
identity deficits can be helped.

24
00:01:36.467 --> 00:01:38.280
Prevention tops the list.

25
00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:42.317
Your homework: watch for the early signs.

26
00:01:43.717 --> 00:01:46.215
Lesson three.
2014.

27
00:01:46.215 --> 00:01:47.682
The Culture Moved In.

28
00:01:47.932 --> 00:01:50.446
Then it wasn't one family any more.

29
00:01:50.446 --> 00:01:54.735
It came through public education, popular
culture and social media.

30
00:01:55.135 --> 00:01:59.786
If your children have unmonitored access
to the internet, you are a negligent

31
00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:00.564
parent.

32
00:02:04.414 --> 00:02:07.449
Your homework: know how many times she
texts.

33
00:02:10.099 --> 00:02:11.255
Add her name.

34
00:02:11.255 --> 00:02:14.552
Every member prays for her, at least once
a day.

35
00:02:21.049 --> 00:02:23.498
Lesson four.
2016.

36
00:02:23.498 --> 00:02:24.595
It Spreads.

37
00:02:24.845 --> 00:02:29.208
It arrived decades ago as a tiny seed.
Now it's in our homes.

38
00:02:29.408 --> 00:02:31.895
One friend comes out.
Then the group.

39
00:02:31.895 --> 00:02:33.640
Then your daughter.

40
00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:39.616
Your homework: share this lesson with five
families.

41
00:02:45.016 --> 00:02:47.524
Lesson five.
2025.

42
00:02:47.524 --> 00:02:48.700
It Has a Name.

43
00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:51.985
A culture swept up by gender ideology.

44
00:02:54.235 --> 00:02:56.512
Now even governments use our word.

45
00:02:58.012 --> 00:03:00.132
The numbers speak for themselves.

46
00:03:02.132 --> 00:03:07.387
Your homework: pray for her protection
from the negative influence of others.

47
00:03:08.787 --> 00:03:10.573
Lesson six.
Today.

48
00:03:10.573 --> 00:03:12.078
When She Is 18.

49
00:03:17.428 --> 00:03:21.489
Those under 18 can involve a full-court
press approach,

50
00:03:21.489 --> 00:03:25.534
while young adults will have the liberty
to make their own choices.

51
00:03:25.934 --> 00:03:28.170
The liberty to make their own choices.

52
00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:30.174
She's eighteen now.

53
00:03:30.424 --> 00:03:34.868
So love her over the long term.
It can take seven to ten years.

54
00:03:43.318 --> 00:03:47.441
Ask anything, any hour.
And when you're ready, a real person.

55
00:03:47.441 --> 00:03:48.285
Free.

56
00:03:53.735 --> 00:03:56.869
If you care about your daughter, finish
the course.
